# SchemeConnect

A web-based administrative platform for managing
government welfare and subsidy programs.

## Features

- Beneficiary Records
- Welfare Performance Analytics
- Governance Audit Center
- Circular Sync

## Tech Stack

Frontend:
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Backend:
- Node.js
- Express.js

Database:
- ...

